      "text": "Trainium3 is Amazon Web Services' third-generation AI accelerator chip, delivered through EC2 Trn3 instances such as trn3.48xlarge with 64 NeuronCores. It is designed for training and inference of large machine learning models and is programmed using the AWS Neuron SDK. In the AI industry, Trainium3 serves as a non-GPU cloud alternative for developers building and deploying generative models, including video and audio systems."
